ilarities in that they use rotting  based abilities however physically  they aren't exactly twins esso looks  like just a run-of-the-mill buff dude  with the exception of a horrific  truly terrifying face on his back  meanwhile kechuzu is well  i don't even know how to describe this  guy other than saying he's a mix of  gluttony from fullmetal alchemist  and mike wazowski from monsters inc but  in the worst way  each of their abilities focus around  rotting away anything that's touched by  their blood  however esso is more powerful potent and  has more options  these include being able to shape his  blood into simple wings  which will give him a little bit of  extra mobility or to attack from a  distance  regardless though once the target has  been infected with the toxic blood  esso is able to activate decay which  puts both a beautiful design on the  affected area  and basically puts that person's life on  a very short timer  their abilities are honestly very simple  but hey it's still made for a damn good  fight the eldest of the three brothers  is chozo and he is easily the most  powerful of  all of them while also looking much more  human than his siblings  to begin with chozo doesn't seem to have  any of the toxic or rotting properties  that his brothers had  instead he's just an extremely talented  user of blood manipulation this of  course allows him to control his own  blood  his most common technique with this  involves cupping his palms together to  make a funnel with his fingers and then  firing off blood in either shots or  streams at incredible speeds and with  devastating force  it is much more versatile than that  though he can also make knives from the  blood and then  rotate the blood within it to  effectively make a very small scale  chainsaw  he can also change his own blood's  composition raising the red blood  cells body temperature and his pulse to  become faster  and stronger making him basically go  gear second  or he can harden his blood an